{{ 'itoro-pdp-overrides.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<div class="it-section it-trust-product">
  <div class="it-tp-inner">
    <div class="it-tp-grid">

      <div class="it-tp-item">
        <div class="it-tp-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#d4af37" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="it-tp-title">
            {%- if product.tags contains 'sellado' or product.tags contains 'nuevo' -%}
              Garantía 3 años (garantía legal)
            {%- else -%}
              Garantía ITorostore 12 meses
            {%- endif -%}
          </p>
          <p class="it-tp-desc">Sin letra pequeña. Reparación o cambio incluidos.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="it-tp-item">
        <div class="it-tp-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#d4af37" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13"/><path d="M16 8h4l3 5v3h-7V8z"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="it-tp-title">Envío gratis en 24–48h</p>
          <p class="it-tp-desc">Correos a toda España. Seguimiento en tiempo real.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="it-tp-item">
        <div class="it-tp-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#d4af37" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="it-tp-title">Pago 100% seguro</p>
          {%- comment -%}
            Solo se anuncia lo que existe de verdad. Comprobado en la pantalla
            de pago real: activos Shopify Payments (tarjeta, Apple Pay, Google
            Pay) y PayPal. Bizum NO esta activo, por eso no aparece.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          <p class="it-tp-desc">Visa · Mastercard · PayPal · Apple Pay. SSL cifrado.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="it-tp-item">
        <div class="it-tp-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#d4af37" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="it-tp-title">WhatsApp 688 809 683</p>
          <p class="it-tp-desc">Resolvemos cualquier duda antes de comprar.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    {%- if product.tags contains 'sellado' or product.tags contains 'nuevo' -%}
    <div class="it-tp-seal">
      <div class="it-tp-seal-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/><polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"/><line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="it-tp-seal-t">iPhone nuevo sellado de fábrica</p>
        <p class="it-tp-seal-d">Caja sin abrir · Todos los accesorios originales · Número de serie sin estrenar · Garantía de 3 años (garantía legal del vendedor)</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    {%- elsif product.tags contains 'segunda-mano' or product.tags contains '2a-mano' -%}
    <div class="it-tp-seal it-tp-seal--blue">
      <div class="it-tp-seal-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2"/><line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12.01" y2="18"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="it-tp-seal-t">iPhone revisado por nuestro equipo técnico</p>
        <p class="it-tp-seal-d">Inspección completa · Batería verificada · Todas las funciones probadas · Garantía ITorostore 12 meses</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    {%- endif -%}

  </div>
</div>

<style>
.it-trust-product{background:var(--it-surface2);border-top:0.5px solid var(--it-border)}
.it-tp-inner{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 48px}
.it-tp-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:0;border:0.5px solid var(--it-border);border-radius:var(--it-radius-lg);overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:14px}
.it-tp-item{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;padding:16px;border-right:0.5px solid var(--it-border);background:var(--it-surface)}
.it-tp-item:last-child{border-right:none}
.it-tp-icon{flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px;width:22px;height:22px}
.it-tp-icon svg{width:22px;height:22px}
.it-tp-title{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--it-text);margin:0 0 3px;line-height:1.3}
.it-tp-desc{font-size:11px;color:var(--it-muted);margin:0;line-height:1.4}
.it-tp-seal{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:12px 16px;background:rgba(21,128,61,.06);border:0.5px solid rgba(21,128,61,.2);border-radius:var(--it-radius-md)}
[data-theme=dark] .it-tp-seal{background:rgba(212,175,55,.06);border-color:rgba(212,175,55,.2)}
.it-tp-seal--blue{background:rgba(59,130,246,.06);border-color:rgba(59,130,246,.2)}
.it-tp-seal-icon{flex-shrink:0;width:28px;height:28px;padding:3px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(21,128,61,.10);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.it-tp-seal-icon svg{width:18px;height:18px;stroke:#15803d}
.it-tp-seal--blue .it-tp-seal-icon{background:rgba(59,130,246,.10)}
.it-tp-seal--blue .it-tp-seal-icon svg{stroke:#3b82f6}
[data-theme=dark] .it-tp-seal .it-tp-seal-icon{background:rgba(212,175,55,.12)}
[data-theme=dark] .it-tp-seal .it-tp-seal-icon svg{stroke:#d4af37}
.it-tp-seal-t{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--it-text);margin:0 0 3px}
.it-tp-seal-d{font-size:12px;color:var(--it-muted);margin:0;line-height:1.5}
@media(max-width:900px){.it-tp-inner{padding:16px}.it-tp-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.it-tp-item:nth-child(2){border-right:none}.it-tp-item:nth-child(3){border-top:0.5px solid var(--it-border)}.it-tp-item:nth-child(4){border-top:0.5px solid var(--it-border);border-right:none}}
@media(max-width:480px){.it-tp-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.it-tp-item{border-right:none!important;border-top:0.5px solid var(--it-border)}.it-tp-item:first-child{border-top:none}}
</style>

{%- comment -%}
  Aqui se renderizaba una SEGUNDA barra de compra fija (it-sticky-cta), ademas
  de la de it-atc-bar. Decidia entre comprar y reservar por la etiqueta
  "bajo-pedido" del producto en vez de por el stock real de la variante, asi
  que en el iPhone 17 Pro Max — que lleva esa etiqueta pero tiene la variante
  naranja en stock — mostraba "Reservar · 50 €" sobre un producto comprable, y
  ademas su boton no hacia nada. La barra buena (it-sticky-atc) ya cubre esto
  leyendo el stock real, asi que esta se retira.
{%- endcomment -%}

{% schema %}
{"name":"Trust producto","settings":[],"presets":[{"name":"Trust producto"}]}
{% endschema %}
